{
  "$comment": "Budgie's default keybinds from the GSettings schemas in nixpkgs nixos-26.05 (budgie-gsettings-overrides, budgie-desktop; XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP=Budgie:GNOME), by scripts/keybinds/extract-dconf-desktops.py: the action is `schema/key`, the label its summary, accels GTK accelerators; type `s` keys hold one accel. Only the keys budgie's labwc bridge reads (the `bridge` attributes of share/budgie-desktop/labwc/rc.xml); an empty media key falls back to its `-static` twin, which is listed instead.",
